reagent-name-ame-fuel = AME fuel
reagent-desc-ame-fuel = Magnetically suspended antimatter in a cryogenic carrier. Enormously energy dense and enormously unwilling to stay put.

reagent-name-ame-catalyst = AME catalyst
reagent-desc-ame-catalyst = A silvered uranium slurry used to bind antimatter into a pumpable suspension. Worthless as a fuel by itself.

ame-fuel-reaction-unstable = The mixture flares a searing violet!

